{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1456725-aberrant-combat-examples","id":1456725,"title":"Aberrant Combat Examples?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-08-12T19:01:04-07:00","id":1456725,"title":"Aberrant Combat Examples?","content":"Hello all, I was just wondering if anyone knows of a breakdown for how the new system plays in combat, and figuring out what the characters can do? I expect to get drafted as the ST for a new game relatively soon and I want to be able to provide a combat example for my players. I have some minor experience with Aeon, and a lot with multiple versions of Exalted (1st edition, 2nd edition, and 3rd edition), and multiple versions of D&amp;D. That being said, the new Trinity system does kind of leave me lost in group combat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1635-citadel97501","name":"Citadel97501","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"544"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-12T20:54:25-07:00","id":1456731,"title":"","content":"There is a combat example in the Core book (Trinity Core, not Trinity Aberrant) but it does leave out a lot of the Aberrant specific powers, edges, etc (being only a Talent vs mook fight). I'd be interested in one being written up or being pointed at one too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26905-eternl-knight","name":"Eternl Knight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26905_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-13T07:35:33-07:00","id":1456759,"title":"","content":"I've run quite a few combat in Aeon, and it flows real well. What has you confused with Aberrant?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-16T00:44:47-07:00","id":1456936,"title":"","content":"I'm not <i>confused</i> so much as I'm looking for a good example of combat where Scale comes into play to give to my players. I'm not great at explaining these things, but find examples of play to be very useful in getting the rules across clearly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26905-eternl-knight","name":"Eternl Knight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26905_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-23T23:13:23-07:00","id":1457550,"title":"","content":"So I haven't yet gotten to the combat yet, but I found Onyx Path has some &quot;Actual Play&quot; videos online for Aberrant that will definitely have combat in there (somewhere). From comments made in Session 0, I think the Storyteller has some house rules regarding the use of skills but we all do something a little different from core rules, so the sessions should be of interest.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V3AdMOhgMt0&amp;list=